      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-3",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "**Draft.** Derived from Rig's [Workspace UI Projection Contract](https://github.com/juliantorr-es/Rig/blob/main/docs/architecture/workspace-ui-projection-contract.md) and adapted for Rig Relay's desktop cockpit.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-4",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Purpose",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-5",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "This contract defines the projection widgets that the backend may render into the Rig Relay desktop cockpit. The frontend is a **renderer, not a governor**.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "h2-6",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "Core Rule",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard",
        "initially_visible": true
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-7",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "**Backend authors the state. Frontend renders the state. Frontend emits intentions only.**",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
      "block_id": "p-8",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "- Frontend must not infer checkpointability, lane readiness, or promotion decisions. - Frontend must not fabricate state. - Missing data degrades to explicit placeholder text, not fabricated state.",
      "disclosure": {
        "level": "standard"
      }
    },
    {
